@startuml

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black

|User|
start
:1. Clicks Resume Test;

|System|
:2. Queries incomplete attempt from database;

if (Attempt found?) then ([Yes])
  :3. Loads saved answers;
  :4. Restores remaining countdown time;
  :5. Renders test page with previous state;

  |User|
  :6. Continues test from where left off;

else ([No])
  :3. Displays no incomplete attempt message;

  |User|
  :4. Views message;
endif

stop

@enduml
